Calibre Douban — personal reading records development extension

The src/ metadata-source plugin is from fugary/calibre-douban:
https://github.com/fugary/calibre-douban
Author: Gary Fu
Baseline commit: deea4743d177e8439103bece4cf8faa4ab4e0f4a (2025-11-08)
Its source is unchanged in this development extension.

The personal/ companion, focused tests, and new documentation were added
on 2026-11-10. The build script now creates both plugin ZIPs and includes
the upstream Apache License, Version 2.0, with each package.

Douban page selectors and Calibre integration APIs were researched from
primary source implementations. No code from the GPL-licensed
threeyang3/douban-import or Calibre examples was transplanted.

This development extension is not an upstream release or an official
Douban product. See docs/VERIFICATION.md for the exact verification scope.
